content:
Marketing is a Discipline.

We set various goals for ourselves like -
-Wake up at 5 a.m. everyday;
-Work out at least 3 times per week;

Until you realize that a lot like Marketing, the results of these efforts aren't immediate; it takes Discipline. 

Marketing is a continuous process of exercise... a habit you develop - conceptualizing, strategizing, testing, optimizing;

If you aren't in the habit of already waking up at 5 a.m. or exercising regularly, it requires that you adapt to different rhythms and work the muscles before you start to see the desired results.
